<title>GERMANY: MG Handel post small 1995/96 net profit.</title>
<headline>MG Handel post small 1995/96 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   7.2     vs 10.5 loss</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     54.7    vs 34.9</p>
<p>    Group transfer to MG AG (loss)	 11.4    vs 30.9</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    54.7    vs 41.7</p>
<p>    Parent transfer to MG AG		 11.4    vs 31.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German subsidiary of Metallgesellschaft AG is Metallgesellschaft Handel &amp; Beteiligungen AG. MG Handel said the fall in copper prices and losses at its subsidiary MG Erz- &amp; Metallhandel GmbH played a major role in its weak results.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
